lm  people who are frightened and desperate  good feeling to have knowing that you're  this person's only hope pretty much you  showed up with justin and nick over time  these rescue swimmers are trained for  the churning waters of the open seas so  this is a very different mission for  them they cannot wear flippers when they  go in the water they have to wear boots  to protect themselves from whatever  debris may be in the water one rescue  swimmer told me he thought his first  rescue mission would be in a war zone  not at home  maurice okay omar so impressive thank  you
 

